{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Apple-style horizontal card slider section inspired by the "Get to know iPhone" section on apple.com.
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Create a horizontally scrollable slider.
    * Display 4 cards.
    * Cards should slide horizontally.
    * Each card must have identical dimensions.
    * All uploaded images must automatically use the same aspect ratio and size.
    * Maintain equal spacing between cards.
    * Show navigation arrows below the slider.
    * Support touch swipe on mobile.
    
    ### Card Structure
    
    Each card should contain:
    
    * Small category text at the top left.
    * Large headline below the category.
    * Large image occupying the lower part of the card.
    * Optional plus button in the bottom-right corner.
    * Rounded corners with customizable border radius.
    * Premium Apple-style spacing and proportions.
    
    ### Images
    
    For every card, create:
    
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    
    Desktop images should appear only on desktop screens.
    
    Mobile images should appear only on mobile screens.
    
    All cards must maintain the exact same image dimensions regardless of the uploaded image size.
    
    ### Content Settings
    
    For each card provide editable settings:
    
    * Category text
    * Headline text
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    * Optional button text
    * Optional button link
    * Plus icon visibility
    
    ### Section Settings
    
    Allow full customization through Shopify schema settings.
    
    Create settings for:
    
    #### Colors
    
    * Section background color
    * Card background color
    * Category text color
    * Headline color
    * Arrow background color
    * Arrow icon color
    * Plus button background color
    * Plus button icon color
    
    #### Typography
    
    * Section title size desktop
    * Section title size mobile
    * Category text size desktop
    * Category text size mobile
    * Headline size desktop
    * Headline size mobile
    
    #### Layout
    
    * Card width
    * Card height
    * Card border radius
    * Image border radius
    * Card spacing
    * Top padding
    * Bottom padding
    * Left and right padding
    
    #### Slider
    
    * Enable or disable arrows
    * Enable or disable dots
    * Enable or disable autoplay
    * Slider speed
    * Number of cards visible on desktop
    * Number of cards visible on tablet
    * Number of cards visible on mobile
    
    ### Section Header
    
    Add a large section title above the slider aligned to the left, similar to Apple's "Get to know iPhone" section.
    
    ### Styling
    
    Use Apple's design language:
    
    * Minimal and premium appearance.
    * Large typography.
    * Rounded cards.
    * Clean spacing.
    * Elegant proportions.
    * Smooth horizontal scrolling.
    
    Keep the category label and headline placement similar to Apple's design, with both positioned at the upper-left area of each card and the image occupying the lower portion of the card.
    
    Generate a complete Shopify section with Liquid, CSS and schema settings so every visual property can be controlled from the theme editor.
    , Keep the current design exactly the same.
    
    Fix the slider behavior so each card snaps perfectly into view when scrolling.
    
    Requirements:
    
    Enable smooth horizontal swipe with finger on mobile.
    Enable drag/swipe support on desktop and mobile.
    When the user swipes or clicks the arrows, the next card must align cleanly and fully inside the visible area.
    Use CSS scroll-snap so each card snaps to the center or start position consistently.
    Prevent cards from stopping halfway or being partially cut off after scrolling.
    Arrow buttons should move exactly one card at a time.
    On mobile, show one main card clearly with the next card slightly visible only if spacing allows.
    Keep all card sizes equal.
    Do not change the current visual design, colors, typography, or card layout. Only fix the slider scrolling and snapping behavior.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-apple-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.title_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_width }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.card_height }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 32px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    scroll-snap-stop: always;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.category_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.category_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: {%- assign tt_ls = block.settings.headline_size_mobile -%}{%- if tt_ls >= 28 -%}-1px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 20 -%}-0.8px{%- elsif tt_ls >= 16 -%}-0.3px{%- else -%}normal{%- endif -%};
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 200px;
    max-height: 200px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-plus-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 32px;
    right: 32px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.plus_bg_color }};
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 3;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-plus-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-plus-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.plus_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-navigation-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_bg_color }};
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled:hover {
    transform: none;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-arrow-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_bg_color }};
    opacity: 0.3;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-apple-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-apple-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-apple-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.category_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-apple-slider-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-apple-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc({{ block.settings.card_width }}px * 0.85);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.card_height }}px * 0.85);
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-apple-slider-plus-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }

    .ai-apple-slider-plus-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-apple-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc({{ block.settings.card_width }}px * 0.75);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.card_height }}px * 0.75);
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<apple-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-apple-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-apple-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.section_title != blank %}
      <div class="ai-apple-slider-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="ai-apple-slider-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_title }}</h2>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-apple-slider-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-apple-slider-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slider-track>
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign category_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_category'
            assign headline_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_headline'
            assign desktop_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_desktop_image'
            assign mobile_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_mobile_image'
            assign button_text_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_button_text'
            assign button_link_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_button_link'
            assign show_plus_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_show_plus'

            assign category = block.settings[category_key]
            assign headline = block.settings[headline_key]
            assign desktop_image = block.settings[desktop_image_key]
            assign mobile_image = block.settings[mobile_image_key]
            assign button_text = block.settings[button_text_key]
            assign button_link = block.settings[button_link_key]
            assign show_plus = block.settings[show_plus_key]
          %}

          <div class="ai-apple-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-apple-slider-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if category != blank %}
                <p class="ai-apple-slider-category-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ category }}</p>
              {% endif %}
              {% if headline != blank %}
                <h3 class="ai-apple-slider-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ headline }}</h3>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-apple-slider-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if desktop_image != blank or mobile_image != blank %}
                <picture>
                  {% if mobile_image != blank %}
                    <source
                      media="(max-width: 749px)"
                      srcset="{{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                    >
                  {% endif %}
                  {% if desktop_image != blank %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ desktop_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                      alt="{{ headline | escape }}"
                      class="ai-apple-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="{{ desktop_image.width }}"
                      height="{{ desktop_image.height }}"
                    >
                  {% elsif mobile_image != blank %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                      alt="{{ headline | escape }}"
                      class="ai-apple-slider-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="{{ mobile_image.width }}"
                      height="{{ mobile_image.height }}"
                    >
                  {% endif %}
                </picture>
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-apple-slider-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if show_plus and button_link != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ button_link }}"
                class="ai-apple-slider-plus-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                aria-label="{% if button_text != blank %}{{ button_text }}{% else %}Learn more{% endif %}"
              >
                <svg
                  class="ai-apple-slider-plus-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
                  <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
                </svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}
      <div class="ai-apple-slider-navigation-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button
          class="ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          data-slider-prev
          aria-label="Previous slide"
        >
          <svg
            class="ai-apple-slider-arrow-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button
          class="ai-apple-slider-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          data-slider-next
          aria-label="Next slide"
        >
          <svg
            class="ai-apple-slider-arrow-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.show_dots %}
      <div class="ai-apple-slider-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-slider-dots>
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          <button
            class="ai-apple-slider-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if i == 1 %}active{% endif %}"
            data-slider-dot="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
            aria-label="Go to slide {{ i }}"
          ></button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</apple-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AppleSlider{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.track = null;
        this.cards = [];
        this.prevButton = null;
        this.nextButton = null;
        this.dots = [];
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
        this.isScrolling = false;
        this.scrollTimeout = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-slider-track]');
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-apple-slider-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('[data-slider-prev]');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('[data-slider-next]');
        this.dots = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-slider-dot]'));

        if (!this.track || this.cards.length === 0) return;

        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.updateNavigationState();
        this.updateDots();

        if ({{ block.settings.enable_autoplay }}) {
          this.startAutoplay();
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
        if (this.scrollTimeout) {
          clearTimeout(this.scrollTimeout);
        }
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        if (this.prevButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.stopAutoplay();
            this.scrollToCard(this.currentIndex - 1);
          });
        }

        if (this.nextButton) {
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.stopAutoplay();
            this.scrollToCard(this.currentIndex + 1);
          });
        }

        this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.stopAutoplay();
            this.scrollToCard(index);
          });
        });

        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          this.isScrolling = true;
          
          if (this.scrollTimeout) {
            clearTimeout(this.scrollTimeout);
          }

          this.scrollTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
            this.isScrolling = false;
            this.updateCurrentIndex();
            this.updateNavigationState();
            this.updateDots();
          }, 150);
        });

        this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.stopAutoplay());
        this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          if ({{ block.settings.enable_autoplay }}) {
            this.startAutoplay();
          }
        });
      }

      scrollToCard(index) {
        if (index < 0 || index >= this.cards.length) return;

        const card = this.cards[index];
        if (!card) return;

        const cardLeft = card.offsetLeft;
        
        this.track.scrollTo({
          left: cardLeft,
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });

        this.currentIndex = index;
      }

      updateCurrentIndex() {
        const scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0].offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_spacing }};
        
        let closestIndex = 0;
        let closestDistance = Infinity;

        this.cards.forEach((card, index) => {
          const cardLeft = card.offsetLeft;
          const distance = Math.abs(scrollLeft - cardLeft);
          
          if (distance < closestDistance) {
            closestDistance = distance;
            closestIndex = index;
          }
        });

        this.currentIndex = closestIndex;
      }

      updateNavigationState() {
        if (!this.prevButton || !this.nextButton) return;

        this.prevButton.disabled = this.currentIndex === 0;
        this.nextButton.disabled = this.currentIndex === this.cards.length - 1;
      }

      updateDots() {
        this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          if (index === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
        this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
          if (this.currentIndex >= this.cards.length - 1) {
            this.scrollToCard(0);
          } else {
            this.scrollToCard(this.currentIndex + 1);
          }
        }, {{ block.settings.autoplay_speed }} * 1000);
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('apple-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AppleSlider{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

